            "id": "20260926A09T1200",
            "title": "投行MD误发邮件，逾百宗项目曝光",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OUqZBkN8JhcIO2DhvuLZExvsUyo6COfMpM6skKkaR9p9gAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260926A09T1200",
            "author": "初露锋芒",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-26 22:55:48",
            "description": "<div id=\"article-content\"><div class=\"article-top-content\"></div><div class=\"comps-contentify-wrap comps-contentify-pc-wrap\"><div class=\"qnt-p\">大摩一名高管发错邮件，把上百个投行项目底牌漏了。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">名单挺全：里面列着大摩在亚洲争抢的100多个项目。主要是IPO，覆盖中、韩、印等地。连欧洲、中东和非洲的项目也有。 </div><div class=\"qnt-p\">牵扯挺广：除了客户公司，还带出了背后的私募和养老基金。甚至包括一些已经搁置的项目。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">后续处理：这名员工发现发错后赶紧撤回了。不过还是被人发到了社交平台上。大摩官方回应说很重视保密，已经迅速采取措施处理。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OEns0BKCAXImBEsy0YXloUyQi1KYjvtrNbXs4A0SfHVlsAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OEns0BKCAXImBEsy0YXloUyQi1KYjvtrNbXs4A0SfHVlsAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;height:100%\"/></div></div></div>",
