            "pub_date": "2026-09-26 22:39:40",
            "description": "<div id=\"article-content\"><div class=\"article-top-content\"></div><div class=\"comps-contentify-wrap comps-contentify-pc-wrap\"><div class=\"qnt-p\"><span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">星环科技</span></span></span>9月21日成功在香港上市，成了首家走18C章特专通道的A股公司。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">募资近6.3亿港元：这次发了1400多万股，定价49块。公开发售特别火，超额认购了70多倍。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">盘子挺大但还在亏钱：它是做AI基础设施软件的，国内排第五。不过目前还没盈利，上市首日股价微跌，市值大概64亿港元。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">股权比较分散：创始人团队合计持股20%出头，是最大股东集团。这次还拉来了<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">浪潮信息</span></span></span>和洛阳国资委站台。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OElpMEmQ4xtD1jlL1jrpJQoAnjEy4OmYo0sjRP8iswxmYAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OElpMEmQ4xtD1jlL1jrpJQoAnjEy4OmYo0sjRP8iswxmYAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;height:100%\"/></div><div class=\"qnt-p\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OxxtXnpWcfw8IBvhi1YkbRD8uV31i-LE4wdTs23FuIXKMAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OxxtXnpWcfw8IBvhi1YkbRD8uV31i-LE4wdTs23FuIXKMAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;height:100%\"/></div><div class=\"qnt-p\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O4echFlpOGwEl5ggv_PPowZIQlTPfEnbVaUuyweSDTdH0AA/1000\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O4echFlpOGwEl5ggv_PPowZIQlTPfEnbVaUuyweSDTdH0AA/1000\" style=\"border-radius:6px;height:100%\"/></div><div class=\"qnt-p\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OXGyvOiFX1XFhRi4fBJ0NOx8nsFVtTO4aEiKdumwOI3CAAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OXGyvOiFX1XFhRi4fBJ0NOx8nsFVtTO4aEiKdu